Spec: Private mobile authority database adapter

Purpose:
  Host portable authority transactions in Android private SQLite storage without destructive recovery.

Owns:
  ./AndroidDatabase.java

Must:
  Use a canonical non-backup private directory, bounded size, full synchronization and parameterized SQL.
  Reject linked paths and corruption; never invoke delete-and-recreate recovery.
  Bound query rows and close cursors, transactions and databases on all exits.
